message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Autonomous AI Infrastructure — Phase 5.3/5.4 Agent Capability Benchmark"
version: "phase5.3-benchmark-v1.0.0 / phase5.4-implementation-v1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-26"
type: software
identifiers:
  - type: other
    value: "dataset_version=phase5.2-dataset-v1.0.0"
license-note: >
  Released under the same terms as the parent "Autonomous AI
  Infrastructure" project. See the parent repository for full license
  text. This benchmark contains no third-party dataset content; all
  agent-task and controlled-runtime records are generated by this
  project's own evaluation code.
notes: >
  This benchmark reports a per-task capability matrix, not a single
  overall score. When citing results, cite the specific task_id, status,
  and sample size — see BENCHMARK_CARD.md. Do not cite an aggregate
  "benchmark score"; none is defined or endorsed by this specification.
